              "id": "qPBWs",
              "name": "Line",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Geometry: every element within ±2 px of the design after fixes (residue = the modal's 1 px CSS border, which Pen strokes don't count).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Zh5Yu",
              "name": "Line",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Fixed in validation: dialog gap 14 → 16 and entrance 200 → 260 ms (.modal outranked .qr-modal); caption margin + line-height (.modal p outranked it); mono line-height 1.17 → 1.3; avatar initials rendered grey 13 px (.qr-identity span also hit the avatar).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "FmYCI",
              "name": "Line",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Expected differences: button reads \"Copy invite link\" where the Web Share API is missing; payload is localhost in dev; mono is the platform stack (SF Mono) not JetBrains Mono.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "sqQDu",
              "name": "Line",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Scannability: implementation SVG decodes at 9/9 sizes (120–762 px) in jsQR and BarcodeDetector (Apple Vision), for QR versions 4–9.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
