                  "content": "Weekly sync — 2 October\n\nAttendees: Jane, Devon, Arlene\n\n1. Launch checklist\n   - QA sign-off by Thursday\n   - Release notes draft (Devon)\n2. Budget review moved to next week\n3. Open questions\n   - Do we need a second reviewer?\n\nNext sync: 9 October, 10:00",
