      "name": "Desktop — PDF viewer",
      "context": "PdfViewer.tsx (docs/file-sharing.md §10.2), lazy-loaded pdf.js PDFViewer. Scrim with 20 px padding; panel min(1240px,100%) × full height, radius 20, surface-2, 1 px separator, shadow-md. Head 60: Close, Pages (PanelLeft, accent-soft when on), name 17/600 middle-truncated + Page n of N (1 page / Loading…) 13 secondary, Search, zoom − {percent} + (100–600 % of fit width; steps 100·125·150·200·250·300·400·500·600; Ctrl/⌘ +/−/0, Ctrl/⌘+wheel, pinch), Download (after the §6 warning). Canvas pdf-canvas (#111113 dark / #ECECF0 light); pages white r2, fit width ≤ 920, 12 apart, text layer selectable, links: http/https/mailto via openLink, internal jump, others nothing. Keys: Esc (search, then overlay, then viewer), Ctrl/⌘F, ← → PageUp PageDown Home End. Reopens on the last page this session. Pages sidebar from 900 px: 200 wide on pdf-sidebar (#F7F7F9 / #1A1A1D), 1 px separator, open by default for more than one page, toggled with a 220 ms width animation (none with reduced motion), held for the session; one column of 128-wide thumbnails at the page's aspect (≤ 182), 20 apart, 16 padding; number 12 under; current page 2 px accent outline 3 outside + accent-text 600; follows the page in view (block nearest) unless the reader scrolls the list; click jumps to the page top. Lazy thumbnails (IntersectionObserver, 2 at a time, 128 × dpr ≤ 2, ~12 MB cache).",
